  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Duke Long asks Old Man Zheng Yuan how the activation of common enemy hatred has gone while Heavenly Court works to keep the Refinement Path Convention running.",
      "chapters": [
        1702
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "char_old_man_zheng_yuan",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_refinement_path_convention"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Old Man Zheng Yuan explains that after eighteen variant human demonic immortals lost to Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable and then tried to deceive him, the venerable sat in a formation for three days and nights. After reading The Legends of Ren Zu he broke through the confusion and created human path killer moves including countless lifeforms, people’s united hearts, and common enemy hatred.",
      "chapters": [
        1702
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_primordial_origin_immortal_venerable",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By that point countless lifeforms has already been activated, and common enemy hatred is effective in the whole of Central Continent. Old Man Zheng Yuan says that once enough human will gathers they can use people’s united hearts. Duke Long treats common enemy hatred as uniting Central Continent’s people in anger and hatred so the convention can continue.",
      "chapters": [
        1702
      ],
